.TH ARCH 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
arch \- Display machine architecture
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBarch\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display machine architecture
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
